Ux4WkdhUDVMeVZFdmxITTJwRG1NT2xMeWQ3QW9iNWFLc0NKUnNqa3Z6ZXk3SGM2eU5jQzVKTklzZUZMYWRSWFBBa2p1WFNwTi15cVJEdThtWHV3VmMxcDVCTkRyT1VkRGNKNVhUTVUzTzNadjB1Wk1nWnVmTXpOMVJFSkRvdGV1TW9KbGkySWJwQnZQQU9YM09sZllEeVI5WlFqejFCV2g0aWN3WFllUG56WlBfTnlXVVlYWnJZWlNfTHhNdVNmXy1NS3R4UQ?oc=5","date":"2026-10-24","zh":"Murphy Pohlad Asset Management LLC 購買 4,848 股 Autodesk, Inc. 股票 $ADSK"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"雲端/軟體","count":2},{"name":"分析師評等","count":2},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-03","period":"2026-01-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/769397/000076939726000015/adsk-20260131.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"We are a global leader in 3D design, engineering and entertainment technology solutions, spanning architecture, engineering, construction, product design, manufacturing, media, and entertainment. Our customers design, fabricate, manufacture, and build anything by visualizing, simulating, and analyzing real-world performance early in the design process. These capabilities allow our customers to foster innovation, optimize their designs, streamline their manufacturing and construction processes, save time and money, improve quality, deliver more sustainable outcomes, communicate plans, and collaborate with others. Our professional software products are sold globally through a combination of indirect and direct channels.","zh":"我們是 3D 設計、工程和娛樂技術解決方案的全球領導者，業務涵蓋建築、工程、施工、產品設計、製造、媒體和娛樂。我們的客戶透過在設計過程的早期可視化、模擬和分析現實世界的性能來設計、製造、製造和建造任何東西。這些功能使我們的客戶能夠促進創新、優化設計、簡化製造和施工流程、節省時間和金錢、提高品質、提供更永續的成果、溝通計劃以及與他人協作。我們的專業軟體產品透過間接和直接管道結合的方式在全球銷售。"},{"en":"Our internet address is www.autodesk.com. The information posted on our website is not incorporated into this Annual Report on Form 10-K. Our Annual Report on Form 10-K, Quarterly Reports on Form 10-Q, Current Reports on Form 8-K, and amendments to reports filed or furnished pursuant to Sections 13(a) and 15(d) of the Securities Exchange Act of 1934, as amended, are available free of charge on the Investor Relations portion of our website at www.autodesk.com as soon as reasonably practicable after we electronically file such material with, or furnish it to, the SEC.","zh":"我們的網路位址是 www.autodesk.com。我們網站上發布的資訊未納入本年度報告 10-K 表格中。我們以電子方式提交或提供此類資料後，可盡快在我們網站 www.autodesk.com 的投資者關係部分免費取得我們的 10-K 表年度報告、10-Q 表季度報告、8-K 表當前報告以及根據 1934 年《證券交易法》（修訂版）第 13(a) 和 15(d) 條提交或提供的報告修正案。到美國證券交易委員會。"},{"en":"Our architecture, engineering, construction and operations products improve the way building, infrastructure, and industrial projects are designed, built, and operated. Our product development and manufacturing software provides manufacturers in automotive, transportation, industrial machinery, consumer products, and building product industries with comprehensive digital design, engineering, manufacturing, and production solutions. These technologies bring together data from all phases of the product development and production life cycle, creating a digital pipeline that supports greater productivity, accuracy through process automation, and insights that enable more sustainable outcomes. Our digital media and entertainment products provide tools for digital sculpting, modeling, animation, effects, rendering, and compositing for design visualization, visual effects, 3D animation, games p","zh":"我們的建築、工程、施工和營運產品改善了建築、基礎設施和工業項目的設計、建造和運作方式。我們的產品開發和製造軟體為汽車、運輸、工業機械、消費品和建築產品行業的製造商提供全面的數位設計、工程、製造和生產解決方案。這些技術匯集了產品開發和生產生命週期各個階段的數據，創建了一個數位管道，透過流程自動化支援更高的生產力和準確性，以及實現更永續成果的見解。我們的數位媒體和娛樂產品為設計視覺化、視覺效果、3D 動畫、遊戲等提供數位雕刻、建模、動畫、效果、渲染和合成工具。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Our architecture, engineering, construction and operations products improve the way building, infrastructure, and industrial projects are designed, built, and operated. Our product development and manufacturing software provides manufacturers in automotive, transportation, industrial machinery, consumer products, and building product industries with comprehensive digital design, engineering, manufacturing, and production solutions. These technologies bring together data from all phases of the product development and production life cycle, creating a digital pipeline that supports greater productivity, accuracy through process automation, and insights that enable more sustainable outcomes. Our digital media and entertainment products provide tools for digital sculpting, modeling, animation, effects, rendering, and compositing for design visualization, visual effects, 3D animation, games p","zh":"我們的建築、工程、施工和營運產品改善了建築、基礎設施和工業項目的設計、建造和運作方式。我們的產品開發和製造軟體為汽車、運輸、工業機械、消費品和建築產品行業的製造商提供全面的數位設計、工程、製造和生產解決方案。這些技術匯集了產品開發和生產生命週期各個階段的數據，創建了一個數位管道，透過流程自動化支援更高的生產力和準確性，以及實現更永續成果的見解。我們的數位媒體和娛樂產品為設計視覺化、視覺效果、3D 動畫、遊戲等提供數位雕刻、建模、動畫、效果、渲染和合成工具。"},{"en":"The AEC Collection, including AutoCAD, AutoCAD Civil 3D, and Revit, aims to help our customers design, engineer, and construct higher quality, more predictable building and civil infrastructure projects, commonly used by AECO industry experts.","zh":"AEC 系列（包括 AutoCAD、AutoCAD Civil 3D 和 Revit）旨在幫助我們的客戶設計、設計和建造更高品質、更可預測的建築和土木基礎設施項目，這些項目通常由 AECO 行業專家使用。"}],"customers":[{"en":"With the new transaction model, we are approaching the final phase of modernizing our go-to-market motion, which includes building more durable and direct relationships with our customers, updating our data infrastructure, and retiring old information systems and business models. We provide technical support and training to customers through a multi-tiered support model, augmented by direct programs designed to address certain specific customer needs. Some of our customers receive support and training from resellers and distributors from which they purchased subscriptions or licenses for our products or services, with Autodesk in turn providing second-tier support to the resellers and distributors. Some of our customers may also purchase support and training from Solution Providers. Other customers are supported directly via self-service using the Autodesk Knowledge Network, which guides","zh":"透過新的交易模型，我們正在接近現代化上市行動的最後階段，其中包括與客戶建立更持久和直接的關係，更新我們的資料基礎設施，以及淘汰舊的資訊系統和業務模式。我們透過多層支援模型為客戶提供技術支援和培訓，並透過旨在滿足某些特定客戶需求的直接計劃進行增強。我們的一些客戶從經銷商和分銷商處獲得支援和培訓，他們從這些經銷商和分銷商那裡購買了我們的產品或服務的固定期限的使用許可或許可，而 Autodesk 則向經銷商和分銷商提供二級支援。我們的一些客戶也可能從解決方案提供者購買支援和培訓。其他客戶可以使用 Autodesk 知識網路透過自助服務直接獲得支持，該網路提供指導"},{"en":"Autodesk is committed to advancing a more sustainable, resilient, and inclusive world. We take action as a business to support our employees, customers, and communities in our collective opportunity to design and make a better world for all.","zh":"Autodesk 致力於打造一個更永續、更具彈性和包容性的世界。作為一家企業，我們採取行動支持我們的員工、客戶和社區，並利用我們共同的機會為所有人設計和創造一個更美好的世界。"}],"competition":[{"en":"The markets for our products are highly competitive, are subject to rapid change, and can have complex interdependencies between many of the larger businesses. We strive to increase our competitive separation by investing in research and development, allowing us to bring new products to market and create exciting new versions of existing products that offer compelling efficiencies for our customers. We also compete through investments in marketing and sales to more effectively reach new customers and better serve existing customers.","zh":"我們產品的市場競爭激烈，瞬息萬變，許多大型企業之間可能存在複雜的相互依賴關係。我們努力透過投資研發來提高我們的競爭優勢，使我們能夠將新產品推向市場，並創建現有產品的令人興奮的新版本，為我們的客戶提供令人信服的效率。我們也透過在行銷和銷售方面的投資來競爭，以更有效地吸引新客戶並更好地服務現有客戶。"},{"en":"Our competitors include large, global, publicly traded companies; small, geographically focused firms; startup firms; and solutions produced in-house by their users. Our primary global competitors include Adobe Systems Incorporated, Bentley Systems, Inc., Dassault Syst mes S.A. and its subsidiary Dassault Syst mes SolidWorks Corp., Intergraph Corporation, a wholly owned subsidiary of Hexagon AB, MSC Software Corporation, Nemetschek AG, Oracle Corporation, Procore Technologies, Inc., PTC Inc., 3D Systems Corporation, Siemens PLM, and Trimble Navigation Limited, among others.","zh":"我們的競爭對手包括大型跨國上市公司；小型、地理集中的公司；新創公司；以及由用戶內部製定的解決方案。我們的主要全球競爭對手包括 Adob​​e Systems Incorporated、Bentley Systems, Inc.、Dassault Syst mes S.A. 及其子公司 Dassault Syst mes SolidWorks Corp.、Intergraph Corporation（Hexagon AB 的全資子公司）、MSC Software Corporation、Nemetschek AG、Oracle Corporation、Proagon AB 的全資子公司）、MSC Software Corporation、Nemetschek AG、Oracle Corporation、Procore Technologies, Inc.PTCp. 等。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2026-01-31","items":[{"name":"Subscriptionand Maintenance","val":6776000000,"zh":"訂閱及維護"},{"name":"Subscription & Circulation","val":6743000000,"zh":"認購及流通"},{"name":"Architecture Engineering Construction & Operation","val":3583000000,"zh":"建築工程建設及營運"},{"name":"Auto CA Dand Auto CADLT Family","val":1787000000,"zh":"Auto CA 和 Auto CADLT 系列"},{"name":"Manufacturing","val":1379000000,"zh":"製造業"},{"name":"Product & Service Other","val":430000000,"zh":"產品與服務 其他"},{"name":"Media & Entertainment","val":332000000,"zh":"媒體與娛樂"},{"name":"Other","val":125000000,"zh":"其他"},{"name":"Maintenance","val":33000000,"zh":"維護"}],"total":7206000000},"geo":{"end":"2026-01-31","items":[{"name":"Americas","val":3178000000,"zh":"美洲"},{"name":"EMEA","val":2794000000,"zh":"歐洲、中東和非洲地區"},{"name":"US","val":2566000000,"zh":"美國"},{"name":"Asia Pacific","val":1234000000,"zh":"亞太"},{"name":"Other Americas","val":612000000,"zh":"其他美洲"}],"total":7206000000}},"peers":["INTU","ADBE","WDAY","CDNS","SNPS"]}}